{"version":1,"content":"<p>為健康着想，或者想慳錢，很多人會選擇「自煮」生活，一開始時，多數人會被幾個問題考起：1.今天買甚麼餸菜好呢？</p><p>2.買哪隻鑊好？</p><p>20cm還是24cm？</p><p>鑄鐵鍋還是易潔鑊？</p><p>深怕買錯，更怕愈買愈多。</p><p>心想，如果有一個鍋，可以簡單做到日常菜式：煎炒煮焗，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T04:25:33.158273+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:00:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T04:18:46.459605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T04:18:46.459605+00:00","content_hash":"86c6192eb1f25593ef5f63dc21fea8a0a9454f46bac3f1f6e14a2a07b6a531df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}